# Documentation example: reading Phoenix event-data JSON (docs/source/adapters/phoenix.md).
# [phoenix-json]
load phoenix ../../../tests/data/phoenix/events.json
describe tracks
scene new event
layer add event pixels
layer add event tracks
where event/pixels energy > 0.1
backend init svg vec output_dir=phoenix-json width=320 height=240
open vec event
backend flush
entry event/pixels next
# [phoenix-json]
